ic","changelog":"Lithium 0.26.3 for Minecraft 26.3.x fixes several issues.\n\nMake sure to take a backup of your world before using the mod and please report any bugs and mod compatibility issues at the [issue tracker](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium-fabric/issues). You can check the [description of each optimization](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium/blob/mc26.3-0.26.3/lithium-mixin-config.md) and how to disable it when encountering a problem.\n\n## Fixes\n- Avoid caching chest inventories when the corresponding block state is a chest half\n- Fix removed player memory leak in MapItemSavedData when maps are in item frames. Also avoid sending unnecessary map data packets\n- Fix entity step up movement collision not including hard entities","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-10-28T22:31:14.497352Z","downloads":1151727,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"BXnzd18M","hashes":{"sha512":"2ca92fb530135d2baddf0ba4cc4f93976234876a38c4aa02b487b2552400f005afcfbeebf5373fb4396fe2020537a42d7597b8da5a52b904355ef51d5fef07ad","sha1":"2d3afe9d43bb2549e23479d8d93e644ff366bebf"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gvQqBUqZ/versions/fWv5bnZk/lithium-fabric-0.26.3%2Bmc26.3.jar","filename":"lithium-fabric-0.26.3+mc26.3.jar","primary":true,"size":919892,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[]},"4efa9466f7d882eef478a6aad6fbf352fb1e1f5b112abef52cad7bbb85056a6e0fcbe73d24150f9490cc321b0990b2d24c10352948b50058dd09faf07fd135ed":{"game_versions":["26.3"],"loaders":["fabric"],"environment":"client_and_server","id":"FZLopf8z","project_id":"xT0lnNE9","author_id":"UF9jencJ","featured":false,"name":"Voxygen 3.0.0","version_number":"3.0.0","changelog":"**complete rewrite of the mod!**\n\n- new default engine that builds chunks on its own threads and stays off the server thread, so generating a ton of chunks no longer tanks your tick time. around 300-600 chunks a second on my pc\n- old way is still in there as the \"ticket\" engine, use it if a mod breaks the new one which it mostly likely won't i hope\n- new config screen, no cloth config needed anymore!! one less mod!!\n- dedicated servers: has been polished and *should* work way better\n- no longer loads full chunks, uses WAY less storage\n- you can now see players and entites from as far as possible\n\nEXPERIMENTAL: far terrain\ngoes past your normal radius without building chunks, only works in singleplayer or when you host\n- detailed ring right outside your radius at full block detail, you set how wide it is. has an option to add trees, grass, flowers and snow in the same spots the real world puts them\n- then a horizon that slowly drops in detail the further out it goes, up to 1000k blocks(although voxy only supports ~32k out i believe)\n- real chunks always replace it when you get close","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-10-24T03:34:34.556959Z","downloads":83526,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"S3d2Jmcc","hashes":{"sha1":"03c0e63b7c89512a01cf8aa2ba227501589acb1e","sha512":"4efa9466f7d882eef478a6aad6fbf352fb1e1f5b112abef52cad7bbb85056a6e0fcbe73d24150f9490cc321b0990b2d24c10352948b50058dd09faf07fd135ed"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xT0lnNE9/versions/FZLopf8z/voxygen-26.3-3.0.0.jar","filename":"voxygen-26.3-3.0.0.jar","primary":true,"size":279650,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[{"version_id":null,"project_id":"fxxUqruK","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"required"},{"version_id":null,"project_id":"mOgUt4GM","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"optional"}]},"c7c89bd6c5f2801ef1575e2e1212202f5a3eff480d73503beff12b1d60dfb751112fccf36e36c243b26b6b492261cef12d8b2c1a92a734bb0b621daa8c158fc5":{"game_versions":["26.3"],"loaders":["fabric"],"environment":"client_only_server_optional","id":"kSxHvs99","project_id":"8BmcQJ2H","author_id":"GIhCykJ9","featured":false,"name":"Fabric 26.3-5.5.7","version_number":"5.5.7","changelog":"## GeckoLib v5.5.7\n\n### Changes\n- Added `1.21.20` to the k